      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "푹신푹신하고 기분 좋아서\n만지면 떨어지기 싫어져야 정상인데!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D479C2E0D479C2E0D558ACE00020AE30BD840020C88BC544C11C000AB9CCC9C0BA740020B5A8C5B4C9C0AE300020C2EBC5B4C838C57C0020C815C0C1C778B370002100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 푸크린의 털은\n뻣뻣하고 퀴퀴한 거 있지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020D478D06CB9B0C7580020D138C740000ABEE3BEE3D558ACE00020D034D034D55C0020AC700020C788C9C0002100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "얘가 샤워하는 걸\n끔찍하게도 싫어하거든...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C598AC000020C0E4C6CCD558B2940020AC78000AB054CC0DD558AC8CB3C40020C2EBC5B4D558AC70B4E0002E002E002E00100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 한 가지 아이디어를 생각해 냈어.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n승부를 가장해서\n거품광선으로 씻기는 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020D55C0020AC00C9C00020C544C774B514C5B4B97C0020C0DDAC01D5740020B0C8C5B4002E00100001BE01000AC2B9BD80B97C0020AC00C7A5D574C11C000AAC70D488AD11C120C73CB85C0020C53BAE30B2940020AC70C57C002100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "거품광선을 배운 포켓몬을\n지닌 포켓몬에 넣고<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n준비가 되면 내게 말해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC70D488AD11C120C7440020BC30C6B40020D3ECCF13BAACC744000AC9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B123ACE000100001BE00000AC900BE44AC000020B418BA740020B0B4AC8C0020B9D0D5740020C918002100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
