      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "푸크린을 깔끔하게 씻겨 주게\n거품광선을 배운 포켓몬을<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n지닌 포켓몬에 넣고 데려와 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D478D06CB9B0C7440020AE54B054D558AC8C0020C53BACA80020C8FCAC8C000AAC70D488AD11C120C7440020BC30C6B40020D3ECCF13BAACC74400100001BE00000AC9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B123ACE00020B370B824C6400020C918002100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "거품광선을 배운 포켓몬을 데려왔구나!\n가짜 승부를 할 준비는 됐니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
